      "body": "EDIT: The translation on test page is showing the non-uk content, instead of UK content. I am raising a bug for this.\r\n\r\nThe translation sheet says ከም  [hyperlink]ኩኪታት[/hyperlink]  ዝኣመሰሉ with spaces either side of the link.\r\nThe cookie banner is however displaying ከም ኩኪታትዝኣመሰሉ with the link running into the next word. This language seems to use spaces between words, and this could be the equivalent of English text saying something like 'such as cookiesand collecting browsing data'.\r\n\r\nI think we need a space after the linked word which is a translation of the word cookies: ኩኪታት\r\n\r\n@ibMadbouly ",
